  title = {Giant {{Perpendicular Magnetic Anisotropy Enhancement}} in \$\textbackslash mathrm\textbraceleft{{MgO}}\textbraceright\$-{{Based Magnetic Tunnel Junction}} by {{Using}} \$\textbackslash mathrm\textbraceleft{{Co}}\textbraceright/\textbackslash mathrm\textbraceleft{{Fe}}\textbraceright\$ {{Composite Layer}}},
